  <diagram id="live-page" name="Plugin Architecture 1.2.0">
<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=22;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Draw.io Scientific Illustrator v1.2.0  ·  Plugin Architecture" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="36" width="1540" x="80" y="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5A6573;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="双宿主 MCP 插件  ·  Codex + Claude Code  ·  从用户描述到实时画布的端到端路径" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="18" width="1540" x="80" y="78" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer1-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#232F3E;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=14;fontStyle=1;letterSpacing=1;" value="①  USER  ·  用户层" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="100" width="1540" x="80" y="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="user-icon" parent="1" style="shape=umlActor;sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#232F3E;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontStyle=1;labelPosition=bottom;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;" value="User / Developer" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="60" width="60" x="810" y="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="user-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;" value="用自然语言描述想要的图" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="280" x="900" y="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer2-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3EBFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" value="②  AI HOST  ·  双宿主运行时" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="200" width="1540" x="80" y="240" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer2-lb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#581C87;fontFamily=Helvetica;letterSpacing=1;" value="②  AI Host  ·  双宿主运行时" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="440" x="96" y="246" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="600" x="200" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="200" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Codex Desktop / Codex CLI" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="220" y="306" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="• 启动时加载 .codex-plugin 下的 .mcp.json 与 Skill 元数据\n• 调用 drawio-live Skill 引导模型按 MCP 协议工作\n• 终端权限：可以执行 codex plugin marketplace add / codex plugin add\n• 自带 Node 22+ 运行时,无需外部 node" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="220" y="336" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8C4FFF;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="600" x="900" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#8C4FFF;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="900" y="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="Claude Code CLI" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="920" y="306" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="• 打开克隆目录作为项目,自动发现根 .mcp.json\n• Skill 复制到 ~/.claude/skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md,触发 /drawio-live\n• 通过 MCP stdio 通道调用两台服务器的工具\n• 终端权限有限,纯 Claude 时需在会话内运行 /plugin 斜杠命令" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="920" y="336" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer3-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="200" width="1540" x="80" y="460" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer3-lb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#047857;fontFamily=Helvetica;letterSpacing=1;" value="③  PLUGIN SKILL  ·  技能层" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="440" x="96" y="466" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-skill-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="600" x="200" y="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-skill-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#10B981;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="200" y="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-skill-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="drawio-live Skill  (Codex 版)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="220" y="526" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="codex-skill-desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="路径: plugins/drawio-scientific-illustrator/skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md\n伴生文件: agents/openai.yaml (display_name / short_description / default_prompt)\n\n→ 告诉模型:搜索形状 → 启动画布 → 添加形状/连线 → 截图 → 修正 → 保存 → 导出" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="220" y="556" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-skill-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#10B981;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="600" x="900" y="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-skill-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#10B981;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="900" y="510" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-skill-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="drawio-live Skill  (Claude Code 版)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="920" y="526" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="claude-skill-desc" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="路径: claude-code/skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md (YAML frontmatter + trigger: /drawio-live)\n安装位置: ~/.claude/skills/drawio-live/SKILL.md\n\n→ /drawio-live 触发后,模型按同样工作流调用 MCP 工具" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="560" x="920" y="556" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer4-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF7ED;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="300" width="1540" x="80" y="680" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer4-lb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#9A3412;fontFamily=Helvetica;letterSpacing=1;" value="④  MCP SERVERS  ·  Node.js 子进程 (stdio)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="540" x="96" y="686" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-live-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="230" width="600" x="200" y="730" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-live-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F97316;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="200" y="730" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-live-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="drawio-live  ·  20 个实时工具" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="220" y="746" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-live-tools" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="launch  ·  status  ·  add_shape  ·  add_edge  ·  update_cell  ·  draw_sequence\nscreenshot  ·  inspect  ·  fit  ·  undo  ·  redo  ·  delete_cells\nlist_pages  ·  add_page  ·  switch_page  ·  duplicate_cell  ·  order_cell\nsearch_shapes  ·  save_snapshot\n\n入口: live-server.mjs  ·  通过 CDP 调用 drawio graph API" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="560" x="220" y="776" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-utils-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#F97316;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="230" width="600" x="900" y="730" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-utils-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F97316;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="600" x="900" y="730" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-utils-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="drawio-file-utils  ·  5 个文件工具" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="920" y="746" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mcp-utils-tools" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="drawio_status       ·  检测 drawio.exe / 版本 / 默认输出路径\ndrawio_validate     ·  校验 .drawio 结构 (错误/警告/页面)\ndrawio_inspect      ·  读取 cell / edge 清单用于精准编辑\ndrawio_update_cells ·  按 id 修改 label / style / 几何 (批量 patch)\ndrawio_export       ·  drawio CLI 导出 PNG / SVG / PDF / JPG\n\n入口: server.mjs  ·  通过 drawio CLI 完成转换" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="130" width="560" x="920" y="776" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer5-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="240" width="1540" x="80" y="1000" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer5-lb" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#B91C1C;fontFamily=Helvetica;letterSpacing=1;" value="⑤  DRAW.IO DESKTOP  ·  Electron App + localhost:9333" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="560" x="96" y="1006" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-card" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=1.5;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="170" width="1300" x="200" y="1050" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-stripe" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EF4444;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="4" width="1300" x="200" y="1050" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-name" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="draw.io Desktop  ·  Electron 应用" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="24" width="560" x="220" y="1066" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-info" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=4;" value="• 启动时接受 --remote-debugging-port=9333\n• 独立 profile: ~/.drawio-live-mcp/9333 (与个人 drawio 配置隔离)\n• localhost 调试端口仅绑定 127.0.0.1,绝不外联\n• MCP 工具通过 CDP 协议读写 graph model\n• 同一个进程被两台 MCP 工具同时使用" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="110" width="560" x="220" y="1096" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="drawio-canvas-box" parent="1" style="shape=cloud;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FECACA;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#7F1D1D;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;" value="Visible Canvas\n\n用户实时看到的画布\n(形状 / 连线 / 样式\n按节奏出现)" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="120" width="560" x="900" y="1080" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="layer6-band" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="140" width="1540" x="80" y="1260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="loop-title" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Helvetica;letterSpacing=1;" value="⑥  实时循环  ·  Live Loop" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="22" width="360" x="96" y="1268" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="loop-steps" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#232F3E;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=1;letterSpacing=1;" value="search_shapes  →  launch  →  status  →  add_shape / add_edge  →  screenshot  →  update_cell  →  save_snapshot  →  drawio_export  →  完成" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="1500" x="96" y="1300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="loop-note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="每一步间隔默认 350 ms (可调)  ·  XML 仅在用户明确要求时由 save_snapshot 落盘  ·  drawio_export 走 drawio CLI,生成最终 PNG / SVG / PDF" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="20" width="1500" x="96" y="1336" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="foot-rule" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E2E8F0;strokeColor=none;" value="" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="2" width="1540" x="80" y="1420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="foot-text" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=9;fontColor=#94A3B8;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontStyle=2;letterSpacing=1;" value="drawio-scientific-illustrator  ·  v1.2.0  ·  /drawio-live  ·  双宿主 MCP 插件" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="18" width="1540" x="80" y="1432" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-user-codex" edge="1" parent="1" source="user-icon" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#545B64;strokeWidth=1.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.25;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="codex-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-user-claude" edge="1" parent="1" source="user-icon" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#545B64;strokeWidth=1.5;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.75;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="claude-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-codex-skill" edge="1" parent="1" source="codex-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="codex-skill-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-claude-skill" edge="1" parent="1" source="claude-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=2;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="claude-skill-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-codskill-mcplive" edge="1" parent="1" source="codex-skill-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9A3412;strokeWidth=2;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="mcp-live-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-claudeskill-mcputils" edge="1" parent="1" source="claude-skill-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#9A3412;strokeWidth=2;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" target="mcp-utils-card" value=""><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-mcplive-drawio" edge="1" parent="1" source="mcp-live-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#7F1D1D;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.3;entryY=0;" target="drawio-card" value="CDP / 9333"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-mcputils-drawio" edge="1" parent="1" source="mcp-utils-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#7F1D1D;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.7;entryY=0;" target="drawio-card" value="drawio CLI"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e-drawio-canvas" edge="1" parent="1" source="drawio-card" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#7F1D1D;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;exitX=0.65;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" target="drawio-canvas-box" value="graph model"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
